  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRA ACJR Myanmar Earthquake</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar was hit by a severe earthquake on March 31st. This DRA ACJR responds to the needs in Mandalay and Yamethin.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide humanitarian assitance based on needs in Mandalay and Yamethin.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will target 40% IDPs and 60% affected host community members in Mandalay city and Yamethin Township and 5 surrounding villages.</narrative>
  </description>
